          "=== Rating Prediction Metrics ===\n\nActual:    [5, 4, 3, 5, 2, 4, 1, 3, 5, 4, 2, 3, 4, 5, 1]\nPredicted: [4.2, 3.8, 3.5, 4.6, 2.3, 3.5, 1.8, 2.9, 4.7, 4.1, 2.5, 3.2, 3.6, 4.8, 1.5]\n\nRMSE: 0.5209\nMAE:  0.4400\n\n=== Model Comparison ===\nModel A - RMSE: 0.5209, MAE: 0.4400\nModel B - RMSE: 0.6110, MAE: 0.5133\n\nModel B has higher RMSE because it makes some large errors,\neven though it gets some predictions exactly right."
