          "python",
          "=== Precision@k and Recall@k ===\nRecommended: ['Movie_A', 'Movie_B', 'Movie_C', 'Movie_D', 'Movie_E', 'Movie_F', 'Movie_G', 'Movie_H', 'Movie_I', 'Movie_J']\nRelevant:    ['Movie_A', 'Movie_C', 'Movie_F', 'Movie_H', 'Movie_K']\n\n  k  Precision@k   Recall@k\n------------------------------\n  1       1.0000     0.2000\n  3       0.6667     0.4000\n  5       0.4000     0.4000\n  7       0.5714     0.8000\n 10       0.4000     0.8000\n\n=== Average Precision@5 Across Users ===\n  User_1: P@5=0.600, R@5=0.750\n  User_2: P@5=0.400, R@5=0.500\n  User_3: P@5=0.000, R@5=0.000\n\n  Average P@5: 0.3333\n  Average R@5: 0.4167"
        ]
