          "=== NDCG (Normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain) ===\n\nPerfect ranking: [5, 4, 3, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]\nGood ranking:    [4, 5, 3, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0]\nPoor ranking:    [0, 0, 1, 0, 2, 3, 4, 5, 0, 0]\n\n  k    Perfect       Good       Poor\n-----------------------------------\n  1     1.0000     0.8000     0.0000\n  3     1.0000     0.9654     0.1295\n  5     1.0000     0.9212     0.2856\n 10     1.0000     0.9534     0.5723\n\n--- Interpretation ---\nNDCG=1.0 means perfect ranking (best items first)\nNDCG penalizes relevant items appearing lower in the list"
